#. i18n: file: plugins/extensions/colorspaceconversion/wdgconvertcolorspace.ui:38
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioPerceptual)
#: rc.cpp:140
msgid ""
"Hue hopefully maintained (but not required),\n"
"lightness and saturation sacrificed to maintain\n"
"the perceived color. White point changed to\n"
"result in neutral grays. Intended for images."
msgstr ""
"Nijansa je nadajmo se očuvana (ali ne obavezno),\n"
"svjetlina i zasićenje su žrtvovani radi održanja\n"
"opažene boje. Bela tačka je pomjerena ka neutralnim\n"
"sivima. Namenjeno slikama."

#. i18n: file: plugins/extensions/colorspaceconversion/wdgconvertcolorspace.ui:41
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioPerceptual)
#. i18n: file: ui/forms/wdgapplyprofile.ui:108
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioPerceptual)
